Description: Android-style whole-die CPU+GPU thermal governor for the OnePlus Pad 3 (erhai)
 erhai-thermal.sh implements the same thermal architecture Android uses on this
 SoC: a userspace governor watches the whole-die envelope (CPU + GPU + NPU +
 DDR sensors) and, as it approaches the profile's switch-on trigger, writes
 cooling levels into the kernel cpufreq/devfreq cooling devices - the exact
 levels Android's thermal-engine-v2 produces under the Burnout benchmark
